[{"type":"message","user":"U02DR773E4Q","text":"\u003c@U02DR773E4Q\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1630490471.025400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"891b2e3f-887e-4c98-aae0-5d20e343d529","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"iterateはgeneratorとかもいけるイメージだな","ts":"1630475270.025000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y4P2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29f5293d-8605-4b14-a17b-c1bc7237c5b3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Java の Enumeration は Generics がない時代から存在してたな。懐かしい","ts":"1630472590.023300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RcmSn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cdc966c9-71d4-440f-8eda-e9bc62b316cc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"歴史でいうと JavaにはインタフェースEnumeration\u0026lt;E\u0026gt;とインタフェースIterator\u0026lt;E\u0026gt;があるとか、これくらい?","ts":"1630472548.022700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MnHKY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"847e730f-ec7f-4272-bb4e-a98356874562","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど Rust もか","ts":"1630472545.022500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TNTpM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28a40f7f-2a39-4dde-b40d-0872f61de2a2","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"atusy さんのご指摘と被りますが、enumerate はインデックス（数字）を割り振るイメージが強いですね。 Rust もそう。","ts":"1630472321.021600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d3I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0132de4-41fb-4bd2-99f0-58e40a6dcc58","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあでも両方ある言語ってそんなない気がしていて(あっても歴史的事情とか)、「両方あって用途によって使い分けてます！」ってのはほぼ見ない気がする (Python がそう?)","ts":"1630471872.020300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vEb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d99ca73a-f590-4f38-8aa9-b300a202c976","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"内部実装とは別として順次取り出しなのがiteration、集合の意味での情報のセットがenumeration\n順次処理、というだけなら差がないけど、treeのトラバースをenumerationとしたらちょっと違和感がある、と感じるくらい?","ts":"1630471736.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y6e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7811376-f4b1-4400-bba1-b06546fbe044","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Ruby には Enumerator::Lazy (無限ができるやつ) がありますねぇ","ts":"1630471405.017600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ke9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3edfd256-1462-414e-8b38-13afef4fc73d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"enum というのの影響でなんとなく、固定のものを回すのは enumerate という印象ですね","ts":"1630471347.017100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w0B5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80741a4b-3019-41d2-81db-5d1e197e3a3b","type":"message","user":"U01TQP86UM6","text":"iteratorはiteratorパターンといった共通認識がありますがenumerateはそういうのあるんでしょうか 名付け親による?","ts":"1630471253.016700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=1h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd33f6df-7d3f-4cb1-8e8e-58ffdf2c4d29","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そう言えば Java にも両方ある…ただこれは enumerator は古いみたいな感じ(?)がある… (わからんけど)\n\u003chttps://docs.oracle.com/javase/jp/8/docs/api/java/util/Iterator.html\u003e\n\u0026gt; コレクションのイテレータです。`Iterator`は、Java Collections Frameworkにおいて`Enumeration`の代わりとなります。","ts":"1630471089.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WxMLn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed57d55e-c35a-4989-92b7-b432bd3918c5","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"辞書的には`enumerate`には列挙する以外に数え上げるって意味がありますね","ts":"1630471077.016200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6VIa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16767f39-fb0c-49a0-b952-67fb19d4e2f6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"iterable を enumerable で wrap …なるほどそういうのもあるのか","ts":"1630470968.014800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X1E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"546c786e-a07f-46fd-b8bc-6801a8e1904b","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`for i,v enumerate(iterable):`みたいな感じで、iterableなオブジェクトを `enumerate`でラップするとインデックスと iterableなオブジェクトの要素を使ってループできます","ts":"1630470920.014300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KqrDX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7c0bc93-2ce0-45e7-ac2a-274898d23545","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど。あ、Python は両方ある感じですかね? (詳しくない)","ts":"1630470864.013200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/WRh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df6f093b-d3e6-4ea6-b0e4-420160c201bf","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"iterateはしばしば順序を気にしないものを含み、enumerateは気にするイメージ。Python的に考えると。","ts":"1630470817.012700","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1630470832.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+w/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc6640b3-ef97-4252-b16b-008d682ca6dc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ふとした疑問なのだけど、enumerate (列挙) と iterate (反復) って、ニュアンス的な違いってあるんですかね?\nプログラミングの分野だとだいたい言語(ライブラリ)によってどちらかが使われていて、意味はだいたい同じだとは思うんですけど…\n単語だけ見ると明らかに違う意味なので、使い分けとかあるのかなぁとふと気になりました","ts":"1630470581.011900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NOtmw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b304e28-7eae-4159-abda-f58fec2cc1c8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これ見てる \u003chttps://ikatakos.com/pot/programming_algorithm/graph_theory/topological_sort\u003e","ts":"1630425417.009800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"emPSn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edd56a39-7a7c-41a7-a179-5cc5bdac08eb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"dein.vimのトポロジカルソートの実装が拍子抜けするくらいシンプルだったのでちょっと調べてみたけど、かなり単純なアルゴリズムなのね。もっと複雑な物だと思っていた","ts":"1630425393.009600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"51YIw"}]}]
